      en: ["The Stockport Viaduct was completed in 1840 using 11 million bricks.", "Hat Works is the UK's only museum dedicated to the hatting industry.", "Staircase House is a Grade II* listed building dating back to 1460.", "The River Mersey officially begins in Stockport at the confluence of the Tame and Goyt.", "Underbank Hall is a fine example of a 16th-century timber-framed townhouse.", "The Stockport Air Raid Shelters are an extensive network of WWII tunnels."],
