      en: ["Granted city status in 2012 for the Diamond Jubilee.", "Home to the world's first wireless factory, opened in 1899.", "The Roman name for the settlement was Caesaromagus.", "Chelmsford Cathedral dates back to its 15th-century construction.", "Located at the confluence of the River Can and River Chelmer.", "Hylands Park spans approximately 232 hectares of parkland."],
